---
import servicesPhoto from '../../images/services-photo.jpg';
---

<section class="section" id="services">
	<div class="container">
		<p class="eyebrow">Services</p>
		
		<div class="service-skills">
			<div class="service-intro">
				<div>
					<h3>Programming skills</h3>
					<p class="section-intro">
						I’m a student building my foundations in programming and web development.
					</p>
				</div>
				<figure class="service-photo">
					<img src={servicesPhoto.src}  loading="lazy" />
					<figcaption>Learning and growing together</figcaption>
				</figure>
			</div>
			<div class="card-grid skill-grid">
				<article class="card">
					<span class="card-number">01</span>
					<h3>C++</h3>
					<p>Programming fundamentals and problem-solving.</p>
				</article>
				<article class="card">
					<span class="card-number">02</span>
					<h3>PHP</h3>
					<p>Learning server-side web programming.</p>
				</article>
				<article class="card">
					<span class="card-number">03</span>
					<h3>HTML</h3>
					<p>Structuring clear, accessible web pages.</p>
				</article>
			</div>
		</div>

		<div class="service-skills">
			<h3>Non-Progamming skills</h3>
			<div class="card-grid skill-grid">
				<article class="card">
					<span class="card-number">01</span>
					<h3>Cooking</h3>
					<p>Know how to prepare delicious meals.</p>
				</article>
				<article class="card">
					<span class="card-number">02</span>
					<h3>Cycling</h3>
					<p>Enjoy cycling and have knowledge about bike maintenance.</p>
				</article>
				<article class="card">
					<span class="card-number">03</span>
					<h3>Farming</h3>
					<p>Have experience in growing crops and taking care of livestock.</p>
				</article> 
				<article class="card">
					<span class="card-number">04</span>
					<h3>Gaming</h3>
					<p>MLBB current rank: Mythic Glory(65stars)</p>
					<p>COD current rank: Legendary</p>
					<p>Block Blast highest points: 700k plus</p>
				</article>
				<article class="card">
					<span class="card-number">05</span>
					<h3>Spider handling</h3>
					<p>Have expertise with handling and conditioning of spiders.</p>
				</article>
				<article class="card">
					<span class="card-number">06</span>
					<h3>Gload Mixing and experimentation</h3>
					<p>Have expertise in mixing and experimenting gload or pill to make your spider more
						aggresive and powerful.</p>
				</article>
			</div>
		</div>	
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	.service-intro {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(13rem, 0.7fr);
		align-items: center;
		gap: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 5rem);
	}

	.service-intro .section-intro {
		margin-bottom: 0;
	}

	.service-photo {
		position: relative;
		isolation: isolate;
		width: min(100%, 19rem);
		justify-self: end;
		margin: 0;
		padding: 0.6rem;
		border: 1px solid var(--color-accent);
		border-radius: 0.9rem;
		background: var(--color-surface);
		box-shadow: 0 1.15rem 2.5rem rgb(0 0 0 / 22%);
	}

	.service-photo::before {
		position: absolute;
		z-index: -1;
		inset: 0.45rem -0.55rem -0.55rem 0.45rem;
		border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
		border-radius: inherit;
		content: "";
	}

	.service-photo img {
		display: block;
		width: 100%;
		aspect-ratio: 3 / 4;
		border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
		border-radius: 0.55rem;
		object-fit: cover;
	}

	.service-photo figcaption {
		margin-top: 0.75rem;
		color: var(--color-muted);
		font-size: 0.88rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		text-align: center;
	}

	@media (max-width: 760px) {
		.service-intro {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
			gap: 1.5rem;
		}

		.service-photo {
			width: min(100%, 18rem);
			justify-self: start;
		}
	}
</style>
